The attached patch updates the ASoC AT91 drivers to work with the 2.6.19
kernel.  The AT91RM9200 ASoC platform drivers were also made more
generic in order to support the AT91SAM9260 and AT91SAM9261 chips,
although I was only able to test on a AT91RM9200 platform.

Signed-off-by: Frank Mandarino <fmandarino@endrelia.com>
Signed-off-by: Liam Girdwood <lg@opensource.wolfsonmicro.com>

